-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
Usage: gccli insights compare --activity=STRING --field=STRING --age=FREE-TEXT --year=INT [flags]

Compare a metric with your age group. Needs Insights on in Garmin Connect.

Flags:
  -h, --help                    Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                    Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                   Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header                  Print the column names as the first line of
                                --plain output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"            Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING          Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"            Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                                elevations and weights in table and plain
                                output: auto (Garmin profile), metric,
                                statute_us, statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version                 Print version information.

      --activity=STRING         Activity as insights options prints it: STEPS,
                                SLEEP, FLOORS, RUNNING, CYCLING, LAP_SWIMMING or
                                OPEN_WATER_SWIMMING.
      --field=STRING            Field of the activity as insights options
                                prints it: AVG_SPEED, VO2_MAX_VALUE, AVG_POWER,
                                WEEKLY_AVG_DISTANCE, WEEKLY_AVG_DURATION, STEPS,
                                SLEEP, FLOORS or COUNT.
      --age=FREE-TEXT           Age group as insights options prints it (e.g.
                                40-44, 75+).
      --gender="ALL"            Gender: ALL, M or F.
      --year=INT                Year (e.g. 2025).
      --month=MONTH             Month (1-12). Omit it for the whole year.
      --locale-unit="METRIC"    Units of the answer: METRIC or STATUTE.

gccli: error: --month: invalid month "13": expected 1 to 12
-- table exit --
2
